---
title: ShutdownReceipt · recovery
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef fail stroke-width:1.6px

    [*] --> CreateLost
    CreateLost --> CleanupIntent : BeginCleanup
    CleanupIntent --> TerminalObserved : ObserveTerminal
    TerminalObserved --> ReceiptWritten : WriteReceipt
    ReceiptWritten --> ShutdownWritten : WriteShutdown
    ShutdownWritten --> ComputeAbsent : RemoveCompute
    ComputeAbsent --> Stopped : FinishCleanup
    CleanupIntent --> ComputeAbsent : RetryAbsent [ID absent]
    Stopped --> Stopped : ReplaceAtName
    Stopped --> Restored : Restore [absent, IDs match]
    Stopped --> Refused : Refuse [presence or mismatch]

    note right of ShutdownWritten
        INV IdentifiableByRestore
        Receipt ID equals stop ID.
    end note

    note right of CleanupIntent
        Crash before FinishCleanup
        resumes from committed state.
    end note

    class Restored ok
    class Refused fail
